    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22908" root="شل" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَلْشَلٌ</span></b>  Water, and blood, <i>falling in consecutive
drops;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَشَلْشِلٌ</span></b> . (K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِقّ</span> [or
skin for wine &amp;c.] <i>flowing</i> [or <i>leaking</i>]. (TA.)
And Roasted flesh-meat (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِوَآءٌ</span>) <i>of which the
grease,</i> or <i>gravy, drips;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرْشَرٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَشْرَاشٌ</span>.
(TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شر</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَآءٌ ذُو شَلْشَلٍ</span> (S, O) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَلْشَالٍ</span></b>  (S, O *) <i>Water having a dripping.</i> (S,
O.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also the next paragraph.

